      "type": "grammar",
      "title": "Asking where: …在哪儿？",
      "body": "To ask where someone or something is, say the person or thing first, then 在哪儿？ The word 在 means 'to be at', so you don't need 是 here. To answer, swap 哪儿 for a place, like 这儿 (here) or 那儿 (there).",
      "examples": [
        {
          "zh": "你在哪儿？",
          "en": "Where are you?"
        },
        {
          "zh": "我的手机在哪儿？",
          "en": "Where is my phone?"
        },
        {
          "zh": "书店在那儿。",
          "en": "The bookstore is there."
        }
